                        "name": "Gunnar Mills",
                        "email": "gunnar@gmills.xyz",
                        "username": "gtmills"
                    },
                    "message": "Typically would see something like this on top. Redfish is a hypermedia API. Without a link to `/redfish/v1/Managers/<str>/LogServices/CPER/Entries/<str>/attachment/` the client wouldn't know about this endpoint. \n\nIt just means this commit can't go on its own because it is dead endpoint if it goes on its own. Up to you if you want to rearrange."
                },
